      "variant": "emphasis",
      "note": "Plugin 可在 execute_step 選用 SDK Transport（serialwrap/SSH/ADB）；若回報 outcome=unknown 立即中止並跳過重試與 teardown"
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-evaluate",
      "from": "exec-engine",
      "to": "domain-plugin",
